                <div class="pkg-btn-group">
                    <a href="/destinations/darjeeling" class="btn">Explore</a>
                    <a href="/booking/hotel/darjeeling" class="btn">Book Hotels</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box">
            <div class="image">
                <img src="/images/packages/package-4.jpg" alt="Varanasi ghats">
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <h3>Varanasi</h3>
                <div class="price">₹18,500 <span>₹20,000</span></div>
                <p>One of the world's oldest cities, Varanasi is known for its spiritual ghats along the Ganges and
                    vibrant cultural heritage.</p>
                <div class="pkg-btn-group">
                    <a href="/destinations/varanasi" class="btn">Explore</a>
                    <a href="/booking/hotel/varanasi" class="btn">Book Hotels</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box">
            <div class="image">
                <img src="/images/packages/package-5.jpg" alt="Ooty Nilgiri hills">
            </div>
            <div class="content">
                <h3>Ooty</h3>
                <div class="price">₹24,000 <span>₹26,000</span></div>
                <p>Located in the Nilgiri Hills, Ooty is celebrated for its picturesque landscapes, tea plantations,
                    and serene lakes.</p>
                <div class="pkg-btn-group">
                    <a href="/destinations/ooty" class="btn">Explore</a>
                    <a href="/booking/hotel/ooty" class="btn">Book Hotels</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="box">
            <div class="image">
                <img src="/images/packages/package-6.jpg" alt="Udaipur City of Lakes">
            </div>
